WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:10,550
How long should we rest here?

2
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,360
A black line is approaching from the north

3
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:18,760
Arrive in ten hours

4
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,360
You decide if you want to fight or drive in the dark

5
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:22,760
Punishment at 3:30 in the morning

6
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,360
It was almost dawn then

7
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:27,560
Even if you encounter a ghost in the dark night, it will be within the controllable range. I agree.

8
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,300
Why are you so lucky?

9
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,700
It's a tent and it's packed with pressure.

10
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:43,100
You can sleep in my pickup truck

11
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:45,100
I like sleeping on the bike but

12
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:47,100
Xiao Yanzhu’s tent is so big

13
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:53,240
You don’t have to invite your sister in? You’ll definitely come next time
